                                                "sense_id": "4de301ae-399a-3614-99cf-066db8ccf39a",
                                                "text": "The commendations of this people are not always […]left-handed and detractive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c4069c5-eb13-3da7-afa7-90b5ea940b6e",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa3c5b3-48cc-344d-92bc-8e01923c560f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Performed with the intention of doing harm or in transgression against convention or taboo; following the left-hand path"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "041dacd8-cda0-457c-b88f-468522bd8e57",
                                                "sense_id": "9c4069c5-eb13-3da7-afa7-90b5ea940b6e",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, nearly all magic tends in time to the left-handed path; as being a devious means of attaining desires unobtainable by ordinary methods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e84126f-a94e-3aff-9958-243f4ef0b63e",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa3c5b3-48cc-344d-92bc-8e01923c560f",
                                        "glosses": [
